# FestWiz mode switch — see HALLOWEEN-PLAN.md
#
# Exactly one mode block is active at a time. The identity rule must stay
# FIRST in the active block: it matches requests that already carry the app's
# directory prefix and serves them as-is, which stops the wildcard below from
# prefixing them a second time.
#
# VERIFY ON A PREVIEW DEPLOY BEFORE MERGING TO main. Cloudflare Pages'
# precedence between 200-rewrites and existing static assets is the one piece
# of this that has not been tested against the live platform.

# ── FESTIVAL MODE (active) ────────────────────────────────────────────────
/southbysouthwest/*  /southbysouthwest/:splat  200
/*                   /southbysouthwest/:splat  200

# ── HALLOWEEN MODE ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Comment out the block above, uncomment this one, and swap the About link.
# /halloween/*         /halloween/:splat         200
# /southbysouthwest/*  /southbysouthwest/:splat  200
# /*                   /halloween/:splat         200
